  m_Text: '<size=13>- Puppet Master Example -</size>

    This example shows an Emerald
    AI agent integrated with Puppet Master. This allows an AI to be knocked down
    and to get back up. Because the Layer Collision Matrix is project dependent,
    you may need to adjust these based on what Puppet Master suggests. You can move
    the camera with W, A, S, D, Q, and E. You can also move the mouse (while holding
    the right mouse button) to change the look direction. Please see the Emerald
    AI Wiki''s Asset Integration Tutorials section for a detailed tutorial on using
    PuppetMaster with Emerald AI.'
